properties.description:
The byte-level KV seam under StorageEngine, with its RocksDB and in-memory implementations.

The RocksDB backend opens six column families. Since 2026-09-27 every family of every store draws on one process-wide StoreBudget (--store-memory, default 128 MB):
- a shared LRU block cache holding index and filter blocks;
- memtables charged to that cache through one WriteBufferManager;
- a 4 MiB write buffer per family instead of 64 MiB;
- at most 64 open table files per store.
Registered 2026-09-27; it had no artifact node before.
